==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 6.67~12.67 seconds<sup>200f~380f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
*3 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

